<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1F">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "06">
<configtype typenbr = "1">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1616011" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Radiator Cooling Fan Assembly Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A1616009">Radiator Cooling Fan Assembly On-Vehicle Inspection:K14C</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1616011001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect negative (–) cable at battery.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drain coolant. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1616004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect intercooler outlet hose No.1 (1) and intercooler outlet hose No.2 (2) from intercooler outlet pipe No.1 (3).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A164015.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "50.619mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "127"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect engine harness from radiator.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect radiator cooling main fan motor connector (1) and radiator cooling sub fan motor connector (2).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove reservoir (3).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A164014.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "60.835mm" ver = "01" gw = "194" gh = "156"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect radiator outlet hose (1) and turbocharger water outlet hose (2) from radiator (3).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A164016.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.329mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "135"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove radiator cooling fan assembly from radiator.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove intercooler outlet pipe No.1 (1) from radiator cooling fan assembly, if necessary.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A164024.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.683mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "138"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1616011002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Install intercooler outlet pipe No.1, if removed. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten radiator cooling fan shroud bolt (1) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1F104">
<t-part>
Engine radiator cooling fan shroud bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
7.1
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
0.72
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
5.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A164018.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.329mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "135"/>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
If there is matchmark on each of hose and pipe, install the hose aligning matchmark on hose with matchmark on pipe and then set each clamp to the original position.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten intercooler outlet hose No.1 clamp and intercooler outlet hose No.2 clamp to specified torque. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Refill cooling system with coolant. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1616005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check cooling system for leakage. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1616003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
